import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 254 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal Dependency: The Structure of Strong Ones Almsgiving and All Beings Attachment","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 254 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal Dependency: The Structure of Strong Ones Almsgiving and All Beings Attachment","no":254,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Bestowal System","All Beings Attachment","Single-Point Dependency","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles","08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0254_模块2-唐罗-恩赐制依赖篇.md","filePath":"en/0254_模块2-唐罗-恩赐制依赖篇.md"}'),s={name:"en/0254_模块2-唐罗-恩赐制依赖篇.md"};function a(r,e,l,h,u,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-254-tang-luo-decomposition-bestowal-dependency-the-structure-of-strong-ones-almsgiving-and-all-beings-attachment" tabindex="-1">Entry 254 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal Dependency: The Structure of Strong Ones Almsgiving and All Beings Attachment <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-254-tang-luo-decomposition-bestowal-dependency-the-structure-of-strong-ones-almsgiving-and-all-beings-attachment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 254 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal Dependency: The Structure of Strong Ones Almsgiving and All Beings Attachment&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 4)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-gentlest-chain" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The gentlest chain <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-gentlest-chain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The gentlest chain&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the collective ascension axiom requires &quot;strong ones not ascending alone, lifting Myriad Races forward to evolve together.&quot; Tang Luo achieved &quot;lifting,&quot; but did not achieve &quot;together&quot; — he lifts all beings as they walk, but all beings&#39; feet never learn to walk. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core: order must be written into laws, not into strong ones&#39; good will; the latter can be withdrawn at any time. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong> — this entry is precisely the anatomy of the words &quot;high dependency.&quot; The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s energy-level waste is a kind of &quot;relational waste&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Recipients enfeebled</strong>: every alms weakens the recipient&#39;s self-reliance. The more Tang Luo gives, the less all beings dare to venture on their own — ability atrophies under repeated acceptance of alms</li><li><strong>Supervision vacant</strong>: without Alaya-style multi-layer supervision, Tang Luo&#39;s bestowal depends entirely on his personal judgment of &quot;who deserves it, how much.&quot; Judgment bias has no check; energy mismatch has no correction</li><li><strong>Network single-pointed</strong>: billions of beings&#39; evolution resources are all distributed through this one node of Tang Luo. His node exists, the network exists; his node breaks, the whole network paralyzes — this is the most expensive network architecture</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste quantification: civilization energy that could support ten thousand independent evolution nodes is compressed into one &quot;super dealer.&quot; <strong>Civilization&#39;s muscle has grown into one person&#39;s arm.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s historical regression is written into the structure:</p><ol><li><strong>Benefactor dependency chain</strong>: all beings take &quot;being almsgiven&quot; as a survival mode, no longer investing in their own hematopoiesis. Tang Luo is here, all is well; Tang Luo goes into seclusion for a year, society immediately shows &quot;cutoff panic&quot;</li><li><strong>Selective disability</strong>: recipients have no ownership consciousness. Knowledge is &quot;what Tang Luo gave,&quot; so they will not maintain, iterate, or defend it — transmission fluctuates with the benefactor&#39;s mood</li><li><strong>Flattery politicized</strong>: under the bestowal system, being close to the center of power is more cost-effective than improving oneself. Civilization&#39;s clever minds begin studying &quot;how to please Tang Luo&quot; rather than &quot;how to break through realms&quot; — this is all attachment-type civilizations&#39; internal-friction law</li></ol><p>The historical regression form is &quot;euthanasia&quot;: no war, no collapse, just day by day less able to walk on its own.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Depriving subjectivity is predation</strong>: the bestowal system&#39;s most hidden predation is depriving all beings of the belief &quot;I can create myself.&quot; Tang Luo gave you everything, except the legal confirmation of &quot;you were already qualified.&quot;</li><li><strong>Attachment is a chain</strong>: all beings attach to strong ones for survival; on the surface the benefactor is giving, but actually all beings have mortgaged the sovereignty of evolution. This is not Tang Luo&#39;s conspiracy, but the bestowal structure&#39;s automatic product</li><li><strong>Good will&#39;s closed loop</strong>: the kinder Tang Luo is, the deeper the attachment; the deeper the attachment, the more all beings cannot leave him; cannot leave, the less they dare question any of his decisions — good will ultimately closes into unchecked power</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo is the <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, and a specimen of bestowal-style predation. His good will is 100% sincere, but a sincere attachment structure is still an attachment structure. He lacks the &quot;righteous rogue,&quot; and even more lacks a set of institutions not depending on him personally.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Bestowal System</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strong ones almsgive, all beings receive</td><td>Myriad Races republican co-building, order legislated by all beings, strong ones are only one of the executing bodies</td></tr><tr><td>Benefactor decides distribution</td><td>Joint Contracting, more work more pay, 20% Activation Strategy; distribution by institution not individual adjudication</td></tr><tr><td>Single-point distribution</td><td>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, distributed nodes, no single-point failure</td></tr><tr><td>Recipients attach</td><td>Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System: evolution qualification is a natural right, not someone&#39;s gift</td></tr><tr><td>Power unchecked</td><td>Anchor Council legislates, Symbiotic Executive Committee administers, Symbiotic Court adjudicates, Anchor Supervision Committee supervises</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: rewrite &quot;Tang Luo gives&quot; into &quot;the system has.&quot; The same good will, once put into institutions, no longer depends on the well-wisher being in office.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate resource distribution network under the bestowal system, marking Tang Luo as the sole distribution node</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A bestowal system; Group B injects Alaya distributed network</li><li><strong>Stress test</strong>: artificially take the &quot;Tang Luo node&quot; offline for ten years, observe A/B groups&#39; civilization survival rates</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group A civilization output cliffs, society disorder; Group B continues running normally — output &quot;single-point dependency collapse index,&quot; expected Group A collapse index ≥ 0.85</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. &quot;Strong one shows grace, all beings are grateful&quot; fits this type of web novel&#39;s emotional logic, internally self-consistent</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. The risk is not setting contradiction, but the author&#39;s narrative fatigue — long-form writing late, it is hard to maintain &quot;Tang Luo is forever merciful&quot; characterization; once Tang Luo turns dark, changes heart, or makes mistakes, all front-loaded &quot;grace narrative&quot; must be rewritten; the author can only force a save with &quot;had his reasons,&quot; which is bestowal-type long-form&#39;s most common ending path</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: extreme risk point. The bestowal system pushes dependency to the ceiling — this entry judges it at the upper edge of the high-dependency band, close to Gu Chensha-style solitary-tree type</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: billions of nodes compressed into one distribution node, network architecture&#39;s enormous waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: depriving all beings&#39; subjectivity is the gentlest yet firmest predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the thicker Tang Luo&#39;s alms, the heavier the chain of attachment</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: bestowal only reaches those who are seen; institutions cover 99%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: single-node networks cannot expand across planes; distributed networks can</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s fundamental problem is not that the almsgiver is not good enough, but that the act of almsgiving itself treats all beings as recipients, not as contracting parties. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s choice: no sages, but a constitution; no alms, but rights confirmation.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a> · <a href="./08-人人有路保障体系.html">08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
